{"3929470": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Warhounds", "steam_appid": 3929470, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4962080, 4961470, 4961400], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warhounds is a turn-based tactical &amp; strategy game, inspired by XCOM and Jagged Alliance, about a mercenary squad with an old-school action movie vibe. Command an elite team of bold, stylish operators, wage a campaign in an alternate-future Africa, and decide the war’s outcome mission by mission.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Be the commander.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Calculate lines of fire and flank angle, break cover, and seize the high ground. Every turn is decided more by your planning and tactics, less - by RNG.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929470/extras/d728a116ffeac0dfc4022a767301a0e0.poster.avif?t=1787155977\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929470/extras/d728a116ffeac0dfc4022a767301a0e0.webm?t=1787155977\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929470/extras/d728a116ffeac0dfc4022a767301a0e0.mp4?t=1787155977\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hire fighters with personality.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine classes: Assault, Specialist, Sniper, Machine Gunner, and Grenadier. Pick the right gear for the job, treat and extract, and protect key operatives. Take calculated risks. High combat lethality makes every decision count.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929470/extras/4c99746ef5af42f87e1ffbc8f9a3c77c.poster.avif?t=1787155977\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929470/extras/4c99746ef5af42f87e1ffbc8f9a3c77c.webm?t=1787155977\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929470/extras/4c99746ef5af42f87e1ffbc8f9a3c77c.mp4?t=1787155977\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Run the base between missions.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit, upgrade, purchase equipment, and handle logistics, finances, medical supplies, and downtime. Choose allied factions, build relationships, gather intel, and execute covert ops. Your choices have consequences: your decisions determine your access to missions, gear, and allies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929470/extras/e1427c85b3240c94529b21780e69c455.poster.avif?t=1787155977\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929470/extras/e1427c85b3240c94529b21780e69c455.webm?t=1787155977\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929470/extras/e1427c85b3240c94529b21780e69c455.mp4?t=1787155977\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Use the tools of tomorrow.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deploy drones, combat scanners, smoke, and optical camo. Upgrade and improve your kit to win under any conditions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Set your own pace.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Knock out a mission in 25–40 minutes, or settle in for a long session. Customize the challenge: go for a brutal tactical hell or a light, relaxing run.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What you’ll get:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No point-blank misses - flank + close distance = 100 hit chance</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real ballistics, destructible cover, vertical gameplay, and cone overwatch.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mercenaries with character and mission-focused loadouts without any busywork.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Base management, contracts, budgets, allies, and consequences for your actions.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assemble your squad. Take the contract. Decide Africa’s future beyond 2035.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warhounds is a turn-based tactical &amp; strategy game, inspired by XCOM and Jagged Alliance, about a mercenary squad with an old-school action movie vibe. Command an elite team of bold, stylish operators, wage a campaign in an alternate-future Africa, and decide the war’s outcome mission by mission.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Be the commander.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Calculate lines of fire and flank angle, break cover, and seize the high ground. Every turn is decided more by your planning and tactics, less - by RNG.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929470/extras/d728a116ffeac0dfc4022a767301a0e0.poster.avif?t=1787155977\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929470/extras/d728a116ffeac0dfc4022a767301a0e0.webm?t=1787155977\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929470/extras/d728a116ffeac0dfc4022a767301a0e0.mp4?t=1787155977\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hire fighters with personality.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine classes: Assault, Specialist, Sniper, Machine Gunner, and Grenadier. Pick the right gear for the job, treat and extract, and protect key operatives. Take calculated risks. High combat lethality makes every decision count.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929470/extras/4c99746ef5af42f87e1ffbc8f9a3c77c.poster.avif?t=1787155977\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929470/extras/4c99746ef5af42f87e1ffbc8f9a3c77c.webm?t=1787155977\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929470/extras/4c99746ef5af42f87e1ffbc8f9a3c77c.mp4?t=1787155977\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Run the base between missions.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit, upgrade, purchase equipment, and handle logistics, finances, medical supplies, and downtime. Choose allied factions, build relationships, gather intel, and execute covert ops. Your choices have consequences: your decisions determine your access to missions, gear, and allies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929470/extras/e1427c85b3240c94529b21780e69c455.poster.avif?t=1787155977\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929470/extras/e1427c85b3240c94529b21780e69c455.webm?t=1787155977\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929470/extras/e1427c85b3240c94529b21780e69c455.mp4?t=1787155977\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Use the tools of tomorrow.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deploy drones, combat scanners, smoke, and optical camo. Upgrade and improve your kit to win under any conditions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Set your own pace.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Knock out a mission in 25–40 minutes, or settle in for a long session. Customize the challenge: go for a brutal tactical hell or a light, relaxing run.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What you’ll get:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No point-blank misses - flank + close distance = 100 hit chance</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real ballistics, destructible cover, vertical gameplay, and cone overwatch.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mercenaries with character and mission-focused loadouts without any busywork.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Base management, contracts, budgets, allies, and consequences for your actions.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assemble your squad. Take the contract. Decide Africa’s future beyond 2035.</p>", "short_description": "Warhounds is a turn-based tactical game about an elite mercenary squad with an old-school action movie vibe, inspired by XCOM and Jagged Alliance. Recruit unique fighters, upgrade your base, and fight for Africa’s future. Less fake RNG, more true ballistics and lethal tactics.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Polish<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929470/b596d57d682c7402779961468ff75c50db741500/header_alt_assets_1.jpg?t=1787155977", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929470/b79bb46d900d0df7145ba66db76fab756931e68e/capsule_231x87_alt_assets_1.jpg?t=1787155977", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929470/b79bb46d900d0df7145ba66db76fab756931e68e/capsule_184x69_alt_assets_1.jpg?t=1787155977", "website": "https://warhounds.game/", "pc_require